# arc-ufw-status — added 2026-08-31, closing a real gap while wiring khaos-lab's
# Security category: `arc sec firewall` (bare, read-only status check) calls
# `sudo ufw status verbose` with no NOPASSWD coverage -- confirmed it would
# hang a GUI button click waiting for a password with no TTY to answer it,
# same class of bug already fixed once for darkstat this session. NOPASSWD
# scoped to exactly the read-only status commands, not `allow`/`deny`/`reset`/
# any state-changing ufw subcommand -- those stay password-gated on purpose.
architect-of-chaos ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/sbin/ufw status, /usr/sbin/ufw status verbose
